Package: rgoogleslides
Title: R Interface to the 'Google Slides' API
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hairizuan Bin", "Noorazman", role = "aut",
           email = "hairizuanbinnoorazman@gmail.com"),
    person("Vicent", "Boned", role = c("cre", "ctb", "cph"),
           email = "vicent.boned@gmail.com")
    )
Description: An 'R' interface to the 'Google Slides' API
    <https://developers.google.com/slides/api>. Create and modify
    presentations programmatically: add slides, insert text, tables,
    images, shapes, and videos, and read slide content back into 'R'.
    Authentication is handled by the 'gargle' package, enabling token
    sharing with 'googledrive' and 'googlesheets4'. Designed for
    reproducible reporting workflows where analysis results need to be
    embedded directly into 'Google Slides' presentations.
